cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "A Breakthrough Feature: Signs of Tokenization Awareness in LLMs"
message: "If you use this code or these findings, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Matson
    given-names: Ekaterina
repository-code: "https://github.com/solidgoldmagikarp/tokenization-awareness"
url: "https://medium.com/@solidgoldmagikarp/a-breakthrough-feature-signs-of-tokenization-awareness-in-llms-058fe880ef9f"
abstract: >-
  A layer-0 transcoder feature in Qwen3-4B (feature 118230) fires selectively on
  English compound words whose tokenization is unstable under a leading
  whitespace, suggesting the model has learned a compensatory signal for
  detokenization ambiguity introduced by its own BPE tokenizer.
keywords:
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - tokenization
  - transcoders
  - detokenization
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-01-14
